  "description": "Read the answer of another HTTP service as a value: a non-success status, a problem document, a timeout and an unreachable host become a failed Sondor.Results Result, never an exception. Reads the RFC 9457 problems of Sondor.AspNetCore back into an Error with its stable code, with bounded reads, a safe error model, per-call timeouts, an opt-in bearer token that only goes to allowed hosts, and a hook for other error formats. Built on HttpClient and IHttpClientFactory.",
